，这其中就有本尊的爹。因为苏白和她长得像，涟漪便认为本尊的爹，苏峰也应该白白胖胖，但面前这三个人都是黑瘦，两个上了年纪，一个还算年轻。到底……哪个是本尊的爹？她可不能轻易露出马脚，让人发现苏涟漪已换了人。“涟漪，你来了？”其中一个上了年纪的流氓看见了她，脸上笑开了花，如同已经见到了白花花的银子。“恩。”涟漪微微点了下头，先不说这人到底是不是苏涟漪的爹，即便真是，她也不想和他过于亲近，更不想同流合污。“爹，我们来了。”苏白对着那老头叫道。除了苏峰，其他两人对看了一眼，都有些纳闷——怎么总觉得今天的苏涟漪，不太一样？院子中除了一伙流氓，便是这户可怜的人家。他们真的狠穷，一个个衣着褴褛，面黄肌瘦。面色苍白的男人大概三十出头，半趴在地上，重病缠身，看起来，这人应该是这家的户主。难怪这家人受欺负，原来是男人病了。农村便是如此，当家男人决定实力，一个家族中，男丁越多，便越强大不受欺负。男人身旁是名老妪，跪在地上颤颤巍巍，头发花白，也是骨瘦如柴，因长年劳作，背已经弯得不能再弯，她颤颤巍巍的哭着，口中苦苦哀求。跪在老妪身旁的是名女子，三十左右，看起来应是病男人的妻子，皮肤黝黑干裂，一看就是长年在外劳作晒伤的结果，她一只手扶着病男人，另一只手则是死死拽着正挣扎的男孩。“你们这些畜生、败类、流氓，我要打死你们！”男孩看起来八、九岁，一双乌黑的大眼恶狠狠盯着面前这伙人，满脸是血，想必刚刚已被揍了一顿。女人吓坏了，赶忙求饶，“各位大爷，孩子还小不懂事，还请大爷大人有大量，奴家给你们磕头了！”说着，手虽然抓着孩子，但却努力弯腰磕头，用力之猛，梆梆作响，黝黑的皮肤也掩不住额头的红肿。“哈哈哈，我说吴氏，咱都是爷们，自然不会和你们这群娘们孩崽子一般见识，只要老老实实拿出钱，咱也不会为难你们。”同样上了年纪的流氓嚣张的说道。“我们家……真没钱了，求求大爷……放过我们吧。”老妪一边哭着，一边哀求。“放屁，那女人身上还没搜！咱都是正经人，不会占女人便宜，这不，涟漪来了，让涟漪搜那女人的身，没钱，咱就走，刚刚这孩子撞了我们苏峰大爷的事，就算了。”年轻的流氓道。涟漪一皱眉，岂有此理，这群人真是猪狗不如！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/mingyiguinu/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "First arrived in another world 009, committing murder \"Dad? Extorting money?\" Su Lianyi said in surprise, she was really afraid of what she was going to do. The two siblings, Su Bai and Su Lianyi, looked very similar. They both had white and fat skin, big round eyes with black and white distinction, and a small mouth that was slightly upturned. Unfortunately, their fat body and wretched temperament turned these two handsome and beautiful siblings into two round fat gangsters. Su Bai's breath was flowing, and there was a sinister and proud smile on his face. \"Yeah, if dad doesn't extort money, where will we get the money? Sister, didn't you say last time that you wanted to buy fragrant powder from Xuebaitang in the county town? The powder is so expensive, if you don't rely on dad, you will rely on your idiot farming to buy it for you?\" \"...\" Ripple thought suddenly I started to question what happened when I was doing the laundry last night - why could a country woman buy so many clothes? Most of the clothes hanging in the yard were her clothes, colorful and in astonishing quantities. Now I finally understood. It turned out to be all stolen money. \"Get up quickly, dad is waiting for you!\" The relationship between the siblings has always been good, and Su Bai was not polite, so he grabbed Lian Ling's wrist and dragged him down the bed, which made the latter very disgusted. She hated physical contact. He shook his hand fiercely, using a lot of force. This deity was already very strong and could win a fight with his brute strength. Now, coupled with Ripple's skill, he even threw Su Bai aside with a casual swing. \"Don't touch me.\" He said coldly and sternly. Su Bai, who was knocked to the ground, was startled, \"Sister, what's wrong with you?\" Lianyi suppressed the disgust in her heart and sat up, \"It's nothing, it's none of my business that dad extorts money.\" The world is inherently unfair. No matter whether it is modern or ancient, all she can do is to be alone, and she can only deceive herself and pretend not to see it. sense of justice? As a modern person, do we still have a sense of justice? The chubby Su Bai struggled to get up from the ground, \"Sister, that family is really out of luck. They can't find any property, not even an old hen, but our wise father suspects that his family has put all their wealth on the women of that family. But since men and women are different, we can't search them, right? This reminds me of you, second sister. Dad said, you will be a part of the benefit.\" After listening to Su Bai's words, Ripple felt a fire in his chest that had no place to vent. Although there are many injustices in modern times, there is still peace on the surface. How can it be like here? \"I don't want any bullshit powder, get out of here.\" He said, kicking Su Bai, who had just stood up, and kicked him again. Seeing that the second sister was angry, Su Bai thought he had disturbed her good sleep, so he rolled out and ran out, \"I know, I was wrong. Sister, please continue sleeping. I won't disturb you anymore. Really, really...\" \"Wait, come back.\" Just when Su Bai was about to leave the room, Ripple stopped him again. \"Um, sister, what else is going on?\" Faced with the second sister's power, Su Bai dared not speak out in anger. Su Lianyi was wearing an undershirt. For modern people, dressing like this is very conservative. \"If I don't go, what are you going to do?\" She reached out and took out a clean beige dress and put it on. The clothes of the ancients were not difficult to wear, it mainly depended on the quality of the belt. \"In addition to dad, Wang Erlei and Zhao Datie are going with him. If you don't want to go, Wang Erlei's daughter-in-law will come. But what dad means is that if you call more people, you will get less money, and the wealth will not go to outsiders. Didn't dad think of my sister first for this fat job?\" Su Bai answered carefully. Su Lianyi could be alone, but she couldn't turn a blind eye or listen. \"Let's go.\" She still felt uneasy. Su Bai followed Ripple out of the room. He couldn't laugh or cry. He touched his lower back and it still hurt. Dad said that women are unreasonable, and this was fully reflected in my second sister. In Sujia Village, the house of Lianyi's family is considered good, but there are still many families who are impoverished. The walls are made of mud and stone, and if you look closely, you can see the gaps. The roof has no tiles, only thatch. When it rains heavily outside, it rains lightly inside. The yard is built with rocks and branches, just like the yard Su Lianyi saw at this time. When Lianyi arrived with Su Bai, three arrogant ruffians with \"unreasonable\" written on their faces were already standing in the middle of the courtyard, including my father. Because Su Bai looked similar to her, Ripple thought that my father, Su Feng, should also be fat and white, but the three people in front of him were all dark and thin, two were old and one was still young. In the end...which one is my father? She couldn't show her flaws easily and let people find out that Su Lianyi had changed. \"Lianyi, are you here?\" One of the elderly gangsters saw her, and his face blossomed with a smile, as if he had seen the white silver. \"Yes.\" Lianyi nodded slightly. Let's not say whether this person is Su Lianyi's father. Even if he is, she doesn't want to be too close to him, let alone join in the same trend. \"Dad, we are here.\" Su Bai called to the old man. Except for Su Feng, the other two people looked at each other and were a little confused - why do they always feel that Su Lianyi is different today? Apart from a group of hooligans, the only other person in the yard was this poor family. They were really poor, all dressed in rags, with sallow complexion and thin skin. The pale man was probably in his early thirties, half lying on the ground, and was seriously ill. It seemed that this man should be the head of the household. No wonder this family was bullied, it turned out that the man was sick. This is the case in rural areas. The man who heads the family determines the strength. The more men in a family, the stronger they are and will not be bullied. Next to the man was an old woman, kneeling tremblingly on the ground. She had gray hair and was as skinny as a stick. Her back was bent beyond measure due to years of hard work. She was trembling and crying, pleading in her mouth. Kneeling next to the old woman is a woman, about thirty years old, who looks like the wife of a sick man. Her skin is dark and chapped, which is the result of sunburn from working outside for many years. She is supporting the sick man with one hand and holding her with the other hand.", "translated": true, "title_en": "Chapter 9"}